        <p>We are holding OUR FIRST ANNUA.L bALI3. Our Stock consisting of High-else i and Inexpensive Furnlture,Beistead Bedding. Carpets, Linoleum. ite.. ttc.. is complete in every way. and the priees have all been reduced. We guarantee a saving to retail buyers of 7s. 6d. in the £, and parties about to furnish, or replenish, will find this a splendid opportunity of saving money. Being WFIOLESALR TiIA.DIIILS, we make no pretence at making outside display. We cordially invite anyone Interested in Furniture to call and inspect our extensive stock of high-grade and cheaper qualities of every kind of Household Furniture, Furniture for the Office, Library, or Hotel.</p>
        <p>Bp ale does not admit lengthy pertieulars.but the following will give a good idea of the genuine seductions we have</p>
        <p>lAN-ING ROOM SUITRa, £6 '5l. Usual Price, £3 15s.</p>
        <p>DRAWING-ROOM-SIIITHS, £4 15s. Usual Prfce. £7 10s. WALNUT or OAK SIDNBOAJWS, £3 10s. Usual Price, £5 ss. CHIPPIiNDA OABINBI,I, £4 15s, Usual Price, £7 is. DINTNG TABLAIS, 20s. to £6 15s. Usual Price, 30s. to £9 104.</p>
        <p>ANTRLS : Speen! line., 30s. Usual Price,22 2s. BIMPOOM SUITES w ith Robe, £5 15.5. Usual Price, 28 Bs. OAR or WALNUT BRDSTBAD3, full size, 351. Usual Price, 50s. 31t. ()AK BHEISTRADS with Mattress, 221. 6d. Usual Price, 2.0.. IRR MATIRRSSRS, full size, 7.3. 11d. Usual Price, 12s. 6d. PRATHER 3361)8, complete 355. llsual Price, 50s.</p>
        <p>OARPRTS AND LIN.A.NUM at Half Usual Price. All goods delivered free any distance. Goods stored any reasonable time free. Hallway fares paid to c ,untry customers.</p>
        <p>Don't buy till you have inspected the bargains at</p>
        <p>THE CENTRAL FURNISHING WAREHOUSE, 8, NEW BROWN STREET MANCHESTER. (Opposite side of Market fit. to General Post Office).</p>
        <p>By Puss } I 7% per Quarter 6s 6d per annum is 9d .-.'per Quarter credit</p>
