        <p>Just published, the second edition of a4B page book fully describing Nasal Catarrah, Asthma and Chronic Bronchitis, and how these dangerous diseases may be eompletely cured at home. The most practical work ever issued, and should be in the hands of sufferers whe desire to speedily cure themselves. This offer stands open for 30 days from this date. A post card giving your name and address will bring you the book free by return post. Address Dept. A 318. Dr. Cassell's Co., Ltd., Ayton Buildings, King Street West, Menchester.</p>
