        <p>COMPLETELY CURED BY ONE BOX OF CUTICURA</p>
        <p>"My hands are now quite cured after using only one box of Cuticura Oint- ment. They improved from the very first night of my putting it on. I had very had hands for over two years; they were as bad in summer as winter. I think it was eczema, for my hands were hot, dry, with Lard skin, like a lot of sores. 71'hey used to itch and bleed, and when I put them in water nobody would believe the pain I endured. I tried no end of ointments and things. They never did me any good,. but I am thankful to say they are quite cured by Cuticura Ointment. W. Packard, Darsham Green Darsham, Saxtnundham, Feb. 9, 1906.4</p>
