        <p>BILL! A RDS. WARRINGTON CONSERVATIVE CLUB v. WARRINGTON LIBERAL CLUB.</p>
        <p>The return match between teams representing these clubs was played at Sankey-street on Tuesday evening. Some very interesting games were witnessed but the home players showed an all-round superiorty and added to the majority they gained over a weak team at the Liberal Club. Scores : •</p>
