        <p>THROAT AND NOSE AFFECTED</p>
        <p>By Influenza—Tongue and Throat Swollen and Burning—Was Un- able to Breathe Large Scarlet Pimples Covered Back of Tongue —Found Swallowing Difficult.</p>
