        <p>. The first team has no match to-day, but a fixture has been arranged between the "A ".team and a team selected from the Manchester and District League. Warrington "A " will be represented by Tilley; Jordan, Cartwright, Jones and Fish: Lambert and Key; Forster, Jolley, Holbrook, Hewitt, Harmer and Br; dshaw.</p>
