      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-02-23_WidnesExaminer_art0143" n="art0143">
        <head>Examiner, Saturday, February 23, 1907.</head>
        <p>The Examiner, Saturday, February 23, 1907.</p>
